omaxian-base (0.1.7) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * Enable the Omaxian OS repository (https://apt.omaxian.org) by default:
    /etc/apt/sources.list.d/omaxian.sources now ships "Enabled: yes".
  * preinst: an omaxian.sources that was only switched to "Enabled: yes" by
    hand (the documented sed) is treated as unmodified, so the upgrade from
    <= 0.1.6 installs the new file without a conffile prompt. Other local
    changes keep the normal dpkg conffile handling.
  * /etc/omaxian-release: OMAXIAN_SHELL="v1.0.4" (Omaxian shell v1.0.4).

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:45:03 +0100

